    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31268" root="عيل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَائِلٌ</span></b>  <i>Poor,</i> (S, Mgh, O, Msb, K,) and <i>needy,</i>
or <i>in want;</i> (S, O;) occurring in the Kur
xciii. 8; (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيِّلٌ</span></b> , (TA,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعِيلٌ</span></b> : (Ibn-El-Kelbee, TA:) pl. of the first
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَالَةٌ</span>, (Mgh, O, Msb, K,) [originally] of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعَلَةٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفَرَةٌ</span> pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَافِرٌ</span>, (Msb,) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُيَّلٌ</span> (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْلَى</span> (S, O, K) and [quasi-pl. ns.]
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْلَةٌ</span></b>  (S, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيلٌ</span></b> . (IAar, TA.) ＝   
